    },
    {
      "text": "While the goat cheese is baking, heat up a dry frying pan over high heat. Add the pumpkin seeds and toast, stirring frequently, until they start to brown and pop. Be careful not to let them burn.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/goat-cheese-and-balsamic-butter-salad/#wprm-recipe-59698-step-0-1",
